--- !u!114 &360327369
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 360327367}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51750e5d769ea7f48a88d92595cccb5c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: 'Shift 3: Checkpoint It'
  concept: 'Long transfers get interrupted. The session layer adds <b>synchronization
    points</b> (checkpoints) to the data stream. If the connection drops, the session
    is <b>resynchronized</b> to the last checkpoint both sides agreed on, instead
    of starting over from zero.


    When the conversation is done, the session
    layer also handles <b>termination</b>: closing the session so both sides know
    it is over.'
  howToPlay: Send a 100 MB file within 60 seconds over a flaky link. Click <b>Insert
    checkpoint</b> to save a sync point. Each one pauses the transfer for 1 s, so
    too many waste time, but too few means losing lots of progress when the link
    drops. When the transfer is done, decide how to end the session.
  lesson: 'Checkpoints trade a small, steady cost for protection against a big loss:
    after a failure, only the data since the last sync point is resent. Sessions
    should end with an orderly release (both sides confirm) rather than an abrupt
    abort, so no data still in flight is lost.'
  feedbackText: {fileID: 627616407}
  fileMB: 100
  rateMBps: 5
  checkpointCost: 1
  reconnectTime: 1.5
  timeLimit: 45
  barArea: {fileID: 1940247562}
  progressFill: {fileID: 1893228527}
  progressFillImage: {fileID: 1893228528}
  lostOverlay: {fileID: 314626696}
  checkpointMarker: {fileID: 1914499667}
  sizeText: {fileID: 1715349071}
  statusText: {fileID: 1150606791}
  statsText: {fileID: 269688168}
  timeText: {fileID: 204975644}
  timerFill: {fileID: 489884649}
  transferControls: {fileID: 1068205783}
  checkpointButton: {fileID: 357043575}
  closeChoices: {fileID: 1620007621}
  gracefulButton: {fileID: 594130109}
  abortButton: {fileID: 966897833}
  leaveOpenButton: {fileID: 190165767}
  explanation: {fileID: 229796012}
  explanationText: {fileID: 833859663}
  continueButton: {fileID: 19660215}
