  m_text: 'Below the session layer, data just moves. The <b>session layer</b> turns
    it into a managed conversation between two applications: it opens it, decides
    who talks when, saves checkpoints so a failure doesn''t mean starting over, and
    closes it cleanly. You''re the session manager. Survive four shifts.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
